# UML source

Use-case and architecture diagrams are also represented in Mermaid so they remain editable in GitHub.

```mermaid
flowchart LR
  U[User] --> C((Compress File))
  C -. <<include>> .-> T((Build Huffman Tree))
  C -. <<include>> .-> E((Generate Huffman Codes))
  C -. <<include>> .-> O((Create Compressed File))
  D((Decompress File)) -. <<include>> .-> R((Reconstruct Huffman Tree))
  D -. <<include>> .-> X((Decode Compressed Data))
  D -. <<include>> .-> F((Restore Original File))
```